# What this module needs on the machine, name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason.
# The format and the kinds are documented in the repository root CLAUDE.md. This file names
# tools and never how to install one, since that mapping is DEPENDENCIES.map one layer up.
# Written by hand, because this module has no sub units to fold declarations from.
iris   | path | iris   | required | config.toml | the tool this configures, and the shell hook in the generated .zshrc execs it
atuin  | path | atuin  | required | config.toml | atuin-history is 1, so every history suggestion is read out of atuin's database
zoxide | path | zoxide | optional | config.toml | extend-cd completes cd from zoxide's frecency database, only that row degrades
